The '''Faceless''' is a monster added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Repentance]]''. It takes on the appearance of a {{e|Gaper}} with most of its head cut off, but with its entire spine still intact. Initially, it wanders around the room aimlessly, occasionally firing out 6 blood shots in a hexagonal shape. Once it takes damage or if Isaac gets close to it, it starts to chase him and fires shots much more frequently. Upon death, it may turn into a {{e|Pacer}} or {{e|Gusher}} but more often the latter.
{{clear}}

